cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "mliport — backend-neutral MLIP inference and workflow framework"
version: 2.0.0b2
message: >-
  If you use mliport, please cite this repository. mliport orchestrates
  upstream MLIP backends and analysis libraries; cite the specific upstream
  software and model publications you used as described in
  docs/citations.md and in the references below. mliport does not have its
  own DOI yet, and no upstream DOI is mliport's DOI.
url: "https://github.com/hydrogen1222/mliport"
